 History
 -------
 
+Unreleased
+++++++++++
+
+- ``run_pending()`` and ``run_all()`` now run all remaining due jobs when a job raises, then re-raise the first exception
+- ``run_all()`` no longer sleeps after the last job
+
 1.2.2 (2024-05-25)
 ++++++++++++++++++
 
